*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_HWPTA_BTS_Template_Commissioning_Recommissioning
    [Documentation]         This test is responsible for commissioning, recommissioning procedures verification.
    ...                     Arguments related to configuration parameters are strongly dependent on current bts
    ...                     configuration and bts type. All default arguments values are created based on the GNB
    ...                     configuration type.
    ...                     Args:
    ...                         - scf_file_path: absolute path to scf file, with xml extension e.g.: /home/ute/scf.xml
    ...                           This file will be used during commissioning procedure.
    ...                         - online_change_param_name: name of parameter for online change operation, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB: actDlRbgRandomization
    ...                             for ENB: actSharedRUIndControl
    ...                         - online_change_param_value: value of online_change_param_name for online change operation, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB: disabled
    ...                             for ENB: true
    ...                         - online_param_dist_name: dist name for online_change_param_name, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB: MRBTS-{}/NRBTS-{}/NRCELL-1 or MRBTS-2137/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1
    ...                             for ENB: MRBTS-{}/EQM-1/APEQM-1/RMOD-1 or MRBTS-2136/EQM-1/APEQM-1/RMOD-1
    ...                         - reset_change_param_name: name of parameter for reset requiring change operation, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB and ENB: timeZone
    ...                         - reset_change_param_value: value of reset_change_param_name for reset requiring change operation, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB and ENB: (GMT+2) Europe/Athens
    ...                         - reset_param_dist_name: dist name for reset_change_param_name, e.g.:
    ...                             for GNB: MRBTS-{}/NRBTS-{}/NRCELL-1 or MRBTS-2136/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1
    ...                             for ENB: MRBTS-{}/MNL-1 or MRBTS-2137/MNL-1


    [Arguments]                                     ${scf_file_path}
    ...                                             ${online_change_param_name}=actDlRbgRandomization
    ...                                             ${online_change_param_value}=disabled
    ...                                             ${online_param_dist_name}=MRBTS-{}/NRBTS-{}/NRCELL-1
    ...                                             ${reset_change_param_name}=timeZone
    ...                                             ${reset_change_param_value}=(GMT+2) Europe/Athens
    ...                                             ${reset_param_dist_name}=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/SYNC-1/TIME-1

    ${bts_type}=                                    hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup

    Verify SCF file exsists                         file_path=${scf_file_path}
    Allow DSS Alarms If DSS On Any RMOD             bts_type=${bts_type}
    Perform Configuration Reset
    wait until keyword succeeds                     10min
    ...                                             5sec
    ...                                             Check Status Of Uncomissioned BTS
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    Perform Commissioning And Expect Site Reset     scf_file_path=${scf_file_path}
    Trigger online parameter change                 dist_name=${online_param_dist_name}
    ...                                             param_name=${online_change_param_name}
    ...                                             param_value=${online_change_param_value}
    Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    sleep                                           3min
    ...                                             reason=Waiting to double check if BTS stayed in OnAir state
    Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Allow X2 Link Alarms
    Trigger reset requiring parameter change and wait for autonomous site reset
    ...                                             dist_name=${reset_param_dist_name}
    ...                                             param_name=${reset_change_param_name}
    ...                                             param_value=${reset_change_param_value}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    wait until keyword succeeds                     20min
    ...                                             10sec
    ...                                             Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    [Teardown]                                      run keywords
    ...                                             Return To Initial SCF Configuration
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             AND
    ...                                             Disallow DSS Alarms If DSS On Any RMOD
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

Trigger reset requiring parameter change and wait for autonomous site reset
    [Arguments]                                     ${dist_name}
    ...                                             ${param_name}
    ...                                             ${param_value}
    ...                                             ${bts_type}=GNB

    Robot Log Operation  Triggering reset requiring parameter change for parameter: ${param_name} to value ${param_value}...

    ${connection}=                                  connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    config_operations.connect                       alias=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value_in_separate_process
    ...                                             dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                             param_name=${param_name}
    ...                                             param_value=${param_value}

    ${credentials}=                                 connections.get_http_connection_credentials
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${bts_host}=                                    Set Variable   ${credentials['ip']}

    ${is_in_desired_state}                          connections.wait_for_desired_site_state
    ...                                             url=https://${bts_host}
    ...                                             timeout=180
    ...                                             should_be_reachable=${False}

    should be true                                  ${is_in_desired_state}
    ...                                             msg=Changing reset requiring parameter didn't trigger autonomous site reset

    Robot Log Result     Autonomus site reset after parameter change has been performed.


Verify SCF file exsists
    [Arguments]                                     ${file_path}

    Robot Log Operation                             Verifying whether SCF ${file_path} exists...
    ${does_file_exist}=                             is_file_existing
    ...                                             file_path=${file_path}
    should be true                                  ${does_file_exist}
    ...                                             msg=SCF file ${file_path} does not exist!
    Robot Log Result                                Verification of presence of SCF suceedeed
